[SPEAKER_00]: just around the tree fund itself.

57
00:07:01,631 --> 00:07:12,793
[SPEAKER_00]: And I'm assuming this is something that would be managed by, or I guess I should ask, is this something that would be managed by the DPW, by the tree warden?

58
