00:09:27,206 --> 00:09:27,786
[SPEAKER_03]: Councilor Sayeed.

88
00:09:28,207 --> 00:09:30,047
[SPEAKER_02]: This is just to go back to penalties.

89
00:09:30,127 --> 00:09:37,631
